EGSM \cite{EGSM2023} and ESCAPE \cite{ESCAPE2017} decompose matching tasks into smaller components, an idea related in spirit to our approach. However, these methods rely on specialized data structures and search strategies, whereas our algorithm formulates decomposition and recombination entirely through relational operations.Several approaches also employ join-based formulations \cite{DGSM2022,FastGSM2020,Lai2022}, but assume join-only execution or rely on specialized data structures, increasing implementation complexity and reducing portability.

