+        "restricted representation an exhaustive affine scan is O(B*k*r) "
+        "candidate work (B blocks, prime block size k, r undirected steps). "
+        "At the shipping preset its measured wall time and exact operation count "
+        "are recorded by selftest, while the motif-profile route stays below 300 "
+        "exact comparisons/arithmetic operations."
