+        "restricted representation an exhaustive affine scan is O(B*k*r) "
+        "candidate work (B blocks, prime block size k, r undirected steps) and at "
+        "shipping averaged 15,221 exact operations and 0.00094 seconds over eight "
+        "runs; the motif-profile route used at most 129 exact comparisons and "
